console_empty = The latest 200 statements the engine runs appear here as they run, including typed writes and queries. Durable browser databases log to the browser’s developer console instead. The log can contain record values.
clear_log = Clear
gallery_help = The same pictures stored twice: once with the bytes inline, once as a lazy blob column that a row fault never reads. Seed, then scroll each list and compare the statement count, the picture bytes the eager rows hold and the blob memo. Seeding leaves every row resident; open a named database on the Database page and reopen it to watch the lazy list fault rows without their pictures. Generated pictures work offline; the download fetches sample photos from picsum.photos.
